 {
  "id": "engine/grid_auto_minimum_clamped_by_fixed_max",
  "note": "CSS Grid 6.6: with a fixed max track size, an automatic minimum's content part is clamped (padding, border and margins still count); an explicit min-width replaces it",
  "root": {
   "style": {
    "display": "grid",
    "width": 300,
